# 1. 🚨 Fix Delete Map Crash (Prisma Foreign Key Error)

### Problem
Deleting a map fails because `Order` records still reference it.

### Fix Options

## Option A (Recommended: Cascade Delete)

- [ ] Open `schema.prisma`
- [ ] Update relation:

```prisma
model Order {
  id              Int   @id @default(autoincrement())
  mapId           Int
  map             Map   @relation(fields: [mapId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  stripeSessionId String @unique
  buyerEmail      String
  amountPaid      Int
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
}
````

* [ ] Run migration:

```bash
npx prisma migrate dev
```

---

## Option B (Manual Fix in Controller)

* [ ] Update `deleteMap`:

```js
await prisma.order.deleteMany({
  where: { mapId: Number(id) }
});

await prisma.map.delete({
  where: { id: Number(id) }
});
```

